 DIGITAL EUROPE TO PORT INFOSOFT'S "CONVEYOR" TO ALPHA AXP......Digital
 Europe will port INFOSOFT's innovative CONVEYOR automatic conversion
 tool to its Alpha AXP platforms. CONVEYOR, developed and produced by
 INFOSOFT of Dortmund, Germany, will enable Digital to provide trans-
 parent downsizing of existing applications and data from mainframe
 environments to its own Alpha OSF/1 environment. Conversion provides a
 faster and more direct path than emulation to the original environments
 of target systems, at a fraction of the cost usually needed for re-
 development. The INFOSOFT agreement covers the use of CONVEYOR across
 Western and Eastern Europe, the Middle East, including Turkey, Israel,
 and Africa.

